theorem angle
  let P be a point                                                    (H1)
  let Q be a point                                                    (H2)
  let R be a point                                                    (H3)
  assume P ≠ Q                                                        (H4)
  assume R ≠ Q                                                        (H5)
  then ∠PQR ∈ ℝ. ∠PQR ≥ 0.

1.  ∠PQR ∈ ℝ. ∠PQR ≥ 0.
    def:stdlib/geometry/angle, from H4, H5
